# Issue #190 — real values come from CI secrets, never hardcoded (AC:
# "API Keys are securely stored in environment variables ... NOT
# hardcoded"). Current bundle id is still Flutter's scaffold default
# (see ios/Runner.xcodeproj) — set APP_BUNDLE_ID once this app has a
# real one before running any lane that talks to App Store Connect.
app_identifier(ENV["APP_BUNDLE_ID"] || "com.example.myFirstApp")
apple_id(ENV["APPLE_ID"])
itc_team_id(ENV["ITC_TEAM_ID"])
team_id(ENV["APPLE_TEAM_ID"])
